<title>USA: Hibbing, Minn., won by Cronin.</title>
<headline>Hibbing, Minn., won by Cronin.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co., Inc., said it won $1.940 million of Hibbing, Minn., general obligation sewerage refunding bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.8329 percent.</p>
</text>
